		"Range : ^7777779 cells around self^000000",
		"Description : ^777777It can only be used while in the Hiding state. On use it deals damage to enemies in range along with a chance of Stun and Blind, and targets that are hit enter a state of taking an additional 20% damage from every physical attack for a set number of attacks. However, boss monsters enter a state of taking 10% additional damage. The Hiding state is released on use.^000000"
