		"[Level 9] : ^777777Verkana Runestone - Materials : Armor Piece of Dullahan 1 ^000000",
		"[Level10] : ^777777Lux Anima Runestone - Materials : Gold 3, Light Granule 3 / increases Runestone craft success chance^000000"
	},
