		"Skill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000",
		"Description : ^777777 Usable only while riding a Warg. The Warg dashes straight in a single line. Using the skill again stops it. If an enemy or a wall is ahead, it collides and stops. If Warg Strike has been learned, the enemy collided with takes damage.^000000"
