		"MAX Lv : 5",
		"^777777Requirement : Tooth of Warg 1 ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777 Active / Damage ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Usable even while riding a Warg. Makes the Warg charge 1 designated target to deal damage. Damage rises as the skill level increases. ^000000",
