		"Skill Form : ^777777 Active / Damage ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Cannot be used while riding a Warg. Makes the Warg leap at 1 designated target to deal damage and hold it down, making it unable to move or hide. The success rate rises according to the target's AGI. ^000000",
		"[Level 1] : ^777777 Damage 600%  / Duration 1 sec + increases with Tooth of Warg skill^000000",
