		"Description : ^777777  When a target approaches within the 3 x 3 cells around the installed trap, it permanently converts the property of the target and of every target in the 5 x 5 cells around it to Water property. It does not apply to boss-type monsters and players, and installing the trap consumes 1 Indigo Point and 1 <Special Alloy Trap>.  It can also be placed under the target's feet, but no more than 1 can be placed at once.^000000",
