		"MAX Lv : 3",
		"^777777Requirement : Knuckle Boost 2 ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Damage ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Fires the large-calibre gun built into the Mado Gear's arm to attack the target and its surroundings. Consumes 1 Vulcan Bullet when used. The higher the caster's BaseLV and DEX, the higher the attack power. Skill range 13 cells. ^000000",
