		"Flame Launcher",
		"MAX Lv : 3",
		"^777777Requirement : Vulcan Arm 1 ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Damage ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Sprays flame at 1 target with a flamethrower, dealing Fire property damage and the Burning status ailment to the target and every enemy in the surrounding range. Using the skill consumes 1 Mado Gear Fuel, and the Mado Gear-only equipment <Flame Thrower> must be equipped or carried. ^000000",
