		"MAX Lv : 3",
		"^777777Requirement : Vulcan Arm 3 ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Damage ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Uses the rapid cooler built into the Mado Gear's arm to deal Water property damage and the Frozen or Freezing status ailment to every enemy in range. Using the skill consumes 1 Mado Gear Fuel and 1 Liquid Condensed Bullet. ^000000",
