		"^777777Requirement : Mado Gear License 4 ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777  Passive ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Remodels the Mado Gear's frame to increase its DEF and Overheat Limit. Overheat is the phenomenon where a Mado Gear that keeps taking damage overheats and takes continuous damage. Raising the Overheat Limit delays the point at which it overheats . ^000000",
