		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Debuff ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777 Generates an electromagnetic field around the user, temporarily making every enemy within a 5 x 5 cell range unable to move. If a target is in the Hover state it is not affected. Enemies caught by this effect also lose SP continuously from the influence of the magnetic field. The Mado Gear-only equipment <Magnetic Field Generator> must be equipped or carried when the skill is used, and it consumes 2 Mado Gear Fuel. If a target caught in Magnetic Field takes Earth property damage or is caught by Quagmire, the effect is released at once. ^000000",
