		"MAX Lv : 3",
		"^777777Requirement : Analyze 3, Neutral Barrier 2 ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Buff ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777 Forms an energy barrier around the user, putting every nearby target other than the user into the Cloaking state. Affected targets are shown semi-transparent and cannot be targeted by attacks or magic. SP is consumed continuously while the skill is in use, and the caster's movement speed is reduced by 20%. The effect range of this optical camouflage moves along with the Mado Gear as it moves. If two Stealth Field effects overlap, the effects cancel out and are released at once. The Mado Gear-only equipment <Optical Camouflage Generator> must be equipped or carried when the skill is used, and 2 Mado Gear Fuel is consumed. ^000000",
