		"Description : ^777777 A target under this effect loses a set amount of SP, and the caster recovers half of that SP. In the case of monsters, it recovers SP equal to the monster's level. In addition, the affected target becomes unable to use magic or skills for the duration. A Makeover Brush is required when the skill is used, and it consumes 1 Face Paint. The success rate changes with the level and stat ability of the caster and the target. It has no effect on boss monsters. ^000000",
