		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Self Buff ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Usable while a shield is equipped. Returns part of the physical damage taken to the area around the user. The maximum reflected damage equals the user's MHP and rises up to 1.5 times with base level. A set amount of SP is consumed every second while the skill is in use. This skill cannot be used together with Reflect Shield.  ^000000",
