	[SKID.LG_BANDING] = {
		"Banding",
		"MAX Lv : 5",
		"^777777Requirement : Pinpoint Attack 3, Burst Attack 1  ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Self Buff ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  If fellow Royal Guards in the party each use Banding and stand within a set distance, ATK and DEF rise and HP is shared. SP is consumed continuously for the skill's duration, and using the skill once more releases it. The more party members, the greater the effect. While in the Banding state, if any target approaches a Royal Guard, the Royal Guard 'coerces' the target and reduces its movement speed. The higher the Royal Guard's base level and Banding level, the higher the chance and the longer the duration of the target being 'coerced'.   ^000000"
