		"MAX Lv : 5",
		"^777777Requirement : Prestige 3, Banding 3 ^000000",
		"Skill Form : ^777777  Active / Damage ^000000",
		"Description : ^777777  Usable when 3 or more Royal Guards are in the Banding state, or even with just 1 while the Inspiration skill is active. Every banded Royal Guard makes a joint attack on 1 target. The number of attacks increases in proportion to the number of banded Royal Guards, and the additional effect changes with it. When the skill is used, every other Royal Guard in the Banding state also spends half of the SP the caster spent.  ^000000",
