		"Description : ^777777  Instrument / whip-only skill. Every target on the whole screen, including the caster, falls into the Frenzy effect. Targets under Frenzy continuously lose HP and SP, gain ATK, and lose a great deal of DEF and FLEE. They also become unable to use items. When the Frenzy effect ends, every affected target is forced into a sitting state for 3 sec. If 7 or more targets fall into Frenzy at once, the god of madness appears and deals 9999 damage to every target under Frenzy. This skill cannot be used outside siege and PVP areas.^000000",
		"[Level 1] : ^777777 AoE 7 x 7 around the caster  / ATK +100 / DEF -20% / FLEE -50%  ^000000",
