		"Description : ^777777 Creates a wall of thorns centred on 1 target. A target that touches the thorn wall takes damage and is pushed back. The thorn wall can be attacked and destroyed, and it is removed once damage exceeding its durability is dealt. If Fire property damage is dealt to the thorn wall, the thorn wall catches fire and turns into a Fire Wall. No more than 1 thorn walls can be created, and using the skill consumes one [Thorn Plant Seed]. ^000000",
